<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cursito</span></b> , āre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. freq. n.</i>
			[curso], <i>to run about, run hither and thither</i>
			(rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.:
			sursum deorsum, * <i><span class="en">Ter. Eun. 2, 2, 47</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">huc et illuc,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 11, 10</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. S. 2, 6, 107</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">modo ad Celsum modo ad Nepotem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 6, 5, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 38</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">excalciatos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Vesp. 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To race, run races</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quomodo Ladas aut Boius cum Sicyoniis
					cursitarint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 3, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			the motion of atoms: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">huc et illuc casu et temere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 44, 115</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
